  r65,"旧-sink-实现可继续工作","",现有 sink 继承 `BaseRowSink` 或实现 `IRowSink`,不需修改即可运行,true
  r309,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r309,缺少可选依赖,"",在未安装依赖时导入或使用相关 sink,抛出明确且可读的错误信息,true
  r432,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r432,输出目录不存在仍可写出,"","用户直接构造并使用 file sink,且 `output.path` 的父目录不存在(例如 `CSVSink(\"a/b.csv\")` 的 `a/` 不存在)",sink close 写出结果时系统应自动创建父目录并成功生成输出文件,true
  r526,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r526,"replace-失败时临时文件被清理",file sink 已写入临时文件,close 阶段的原子替换操作失败,close MUST 抛出异常,true
  r600,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r600,"default-mode-preserves-raw-values",用户使用内建 file sink 且未显式启用 escape 模式,file sink 写出该值,输出的字段值 MUST 保持为 `=1+1`,true
  r600,"escape-mode-writes-formula-like-values-as-text","某个输出字段来自不可信输入且值为字符串 `=HYPERLINK(“http://evil”, “x”)`",file sink 以 escape 模式写出该值,输出的字段值 MUST 以 `'` 前缀写出，以避免被解析为公式,true
  r654,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r654,"built-in-sinks-produce-identical-output-via-fastpath","","内建 sink 同时支持现有接口与 aligned-write fastpath",在相同输入下两条路径写出的结果 MUST 一致,true
  r697,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r697,"sink-close-does-not-leave-a-lock-file-next-to-output",某次 CSV/Excel sink 写出目标路径为 `./out/report.csv` 或 `./out/report.xlsx`,sink 成功 close 并发布最终文件,`./out/report.csv.scalim.lock` 与 `./out/report.xlsx.scalim.lock` MUST NOT 存在,true
  r734,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r734,"optional-sinks-are-not-exported-from-default-facade","",调用方执行 `from scalim.sinks import PandasRowSink`,该导入 MUST 失败（符号不在 `scalim.sinks` 默认导出面中）,true
  r766,"column-excel-close-uses-write-only",调用方已向 ColumnExcelSink 写入列数据,调用 close 保存 xlsx,系统 MUST 使用 write_only Workbook 完成写出且输出可读,true
  r766,"column-excel-save-failure-cleans-temp",close 阶段 openpyxl save 抛出 OSError,异常向上抛出,"系统 MUST best-effort 清理临时 .xlsx.tmp 并关闭 write_only worksheet",true
  r147,"caller-may-drop-source-columns",调用方已向 ColumnExcelSink 写入列,调用方释放本地源列引用后继续写入其他列并 close,系统 MUST 仍能正确写出已接收列且输出可读,true
  r147,"default-path-has-no-implicit-flush",维护者审阅 ColumnExcelSink 公共 API 与 YAML 主线,检查是否存在默认 flush/streaming knobs,默认路径 MUST NOT 暴露隐式列释放或 YAML streaming 配置,true
  r169,"default-column-excel-unchanged",既有调用方仅使用 ColumnExcelSink,执行既有写出路径,"行为与归档前契约一致,不受 StreamingColumnExcelSink 引入影响",true
  r169,"streaming-opt-in-reduces-pre-close",调用方显式构造 StreamingColumnExcelSink 并写入宽表列,在齐备行上 flush 后继续写入,"系统 MUST 允许释放已刷行缓冲,且 evidence 显示 pre_close/peak 低于同 shape 的 ColumnExcelSink hold",true
  r169,"no-yaml-streaming-knobs",维护者审阅 YAML DSL 主线与 schema,检查 streaming/flush 配置面,MUST NOT 出现 write.streaming 或等价 YAML knobs,true
  r188,"multi-batch-append-matches-hold",调用方对 StreamingColumnExcelSink 按 batch 多次 set_row_ids 并写满各批全部列,close 后读取 xlsx,"输出 MUST 与同数据的 ColumnExcelSink 一致,且已刷行缓冲可在过程中释放",true
  r188,"duplicate-row-id-fail-fast",StreamingColumnExcelSink 已登记某 row_id,再次 set_row_ids 含同一 row_id,系统 MUST 抛出错误且不得静默覆盖,true
  r188,"default-column-excel-unchanged",既有调用方仅使用 ColumnExcelSink,执行既有写出路径,行为不受本变更影响,true
  r206,"default-hold-uses-column-excel",调用方未设置 residency 或显式 HOLD 且 excel streaming=False,框架经 `_create_file_sink` 创建文件 sink,系统 MUST 使用 ColumnExcelSink,true
  r206,"window-selects-streaming-column-excel",调用方设置 ExcelColumnResidency.WINDOW 且 excel streaming=False 且无 output_composition,框架经 `_create_file_sink` 创建文件 sink,系统 MUST 使用 StreamingColumnExcelSink,true
  r206,"no-yaml-residency-knobs",维护者审阅 YAML DSL 主线与 schema,检查 residency/streaming 配置面,MUST NOT 出现 write.streaming 或 excel_column_residency YAML 字段,true
  r918,"excel-passthrough-naive-datetime",Excel 路径接收 naive datetime,写出完成,单元格 MUST 为日期类型而非仅因框架 str() 产生的文本,true
  r918,"excel-aware-datetime-surfaces-openpyxl-error","Excel 路径接收 timezone-aware datetime",写出,MUST 暴露与 openpyxl 一致的 TypeError（不得静默去 tz 或 str）,true
  r920,"excel-accept-set-documents-openpyxl-capable-types","",查询内建 Excel sink 的 accept set,MUST 覆盖 openpyxl 可写的推荐标量/时间类型且 MUST NOT 声称接受经探测不可写的 np.datetime64,true
  r921,"precheck-off-defers-type-error-to-sink","opt-in 预检关闭且细胞含 openpyxl 拒绝的类型",执行写出,MUST 在 sink write/close 边界失败而非 ROWS 捕获时失败,true
  r921,"precheck-on-fails-before-sink-write","opt-in 预检启用且目标为 Excel accept set",准备写入不被 accept 的类型,MUST 在首次写出前 TypeError，且最终输出路径 MUST NOT 被创建/替换,true
  r922,"failure-path-uses-discard-not-close",file sink 写出过程中失败且框架进入失败收尾,清理半成品,MUST 走 discard（或等价显式失败收尾），MUST NOT 用 close 完成原子 promote,true
  r923,"isink-declares-discard",自定义类型声称实现 ISink,未实现 discard 方法,MUST 无法作为合法 ISink 实现通过静态/运行时合约检查（ABC 或等价）,true
  r923,"memory-sink-discard-is-callable-noop",InMemoryRowsSink 已写入若干行,调用 discard,MUST 成功返回且后续不得被当作已成功 close 的产物使用（可清空或标记关闭）,true
  r924,"excel-discard-leaves-no-final-file",ExcelSink 已 write 若干行但尚未成功 close,调用 discard,"最终 output_path MUST NOT 存在；Scalim temp MUST best-effort 清理",true